  "name": "Recruiting and Candidate screening automation",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "00f412bf-b45c-4257-b71d-37bcb33cdfe1",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -480,
        352
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 480,
        "height": 832,
        "content": "## Recruiting and Candidate screening automation\n\n### How it works\n\nThis workflow automates early-stage candidate screening from a CV upload. It captures a CV through a form, extracts the document content, validates the submission, and sends the result to an AI agent for scoring and summarization. The final candidate record is then created in ClickUp for the recruiting team to review.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- Configure the CV Upload form fields, including the file upload field expected by the extraction node.\n- Set up the file extraction node so it reads the uploaded CV file format used by candidates.\n- Define the validation conditions required for a submission to proceed, such as required fields or successful text extraction.\n- Add credentials for the OpenRouter chat model used by the AI agent and configure the agent prompt/scoring criteria.\n- Connect ClickUp credentials and choose the correct workspace, space, folder, list, and fields for candidate creation.\n\n### Customization\n\nAdjust the AI scoring prompt to match the role, seniority level, required skills, and evaluation rubric. You can also customize the ClickUp fields to store score, summary, skills, experience level, and recruiter notes."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "00fe1359-a739-457e-8c1a-767b61768417",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        80,
        432
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 304,
        "content": "## Collect and validate CV\n\nReceives a candidate's CV through the form, extracts the file contents, and checks that the submission is valid before continuing."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "098cf8cb-ce9d-4c7a-a563-6437a1cdefeb",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        752,
        384
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 352,
        "height": 544,
        "content": "## Score candidate with AI\n\nUses the AI agent and its connected chat model to review the extracted CV content, generate a candidate score, and create a screening summary."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "33a32506-e513-436f-8d3a-bf35da7776bb",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1136,
        352
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 240,
        "height": 384,
        "content": "## Create ClickUp candidate\n\nAdds the screened candidate and AI-generated evaluation details to ClickUp for recruiting follow-up."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "14e5109e-9129-40e1-ae95-f02aca585d2f",
      "name": "Candidate Scoring Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "position": [
        800,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "text": "=You are an AI assistant to validate the candidate experience and skills.\n\nPlace a score from 0 to 1000 and define best fitting role in our company.\n\nPlace contact details above the message.\n\nCV content:\n{{ $('Extract CV Details').item.json.text }}\n\nOptional message from candidate:\n\"{{ $('When CV Uploaded').item.json['Message to the recruiter'] }}\"",
        "options": {},
        "promptType": "define"
      },
      "typeVersion": 3.1
    },
    {
      "id": "30b7e4be-7d9d-4a61-b10b-7f2d02bc4a06",
      "name": "Add to ClickUp Task List",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.clickUp",
      "position": [
        1184,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "name": "={{ $('Extract CV Details').item.json.info.Title }} {{ $('When CV Uploaded').item.json.CV.size }}",
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "additionalFields": {
          "content": "={{ $json.output }}",
          "startDate": "2026-07-05T00:00:00"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "clickUpOAuth2Api": {
          "id": "HGriRB0WwxQQ9km0",
          "name": "ClickUp OAuth2 API"
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "e43fee7e-4c64-4baa-aa05-b4f3d29e3f6f",
      "name": "Check CV Submission Validity",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "position": [
        576,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "version": 3,
            "leftValue": "",
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "typeValidation": "strict"
          },
          "combinator": "and",
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c7f54633-73fa-4483-ac20-119d1a150335",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "exists",
                "singleValue": true
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.text }}",
              "rightValue": "=({{ $input.item.binary.CV }})"
            },
            {
              "id": "cdc6fe9c-a790-4784-af57-77f71e856e82",
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $('When CV Uploaded').item.json['What is 2+10+4?'] }}",
              "rightValue": 16
            },
            {
              "id": "e5040db7-12d0-4ed9-a138-3b4a0d64001b",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              },
              "leftValue": "={{ $('When CV Uploaded').item.json['I acknowledge and agree that my uploaded CV will be processed by automated systems and human reviewers for recruitment evaluation purposes. I understand this information may be stored in our hiring platform and accessed by relevant team members involved in candidate selection.'] }}",
              "rightValue": "I agree"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "typeVersion": 2.3
    },
    {
      "id": "4de06af2-f004-4295-9fd5-eb0bdb9826c5",
      "name": "Extract CV Details",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.extractFromFile",
      "position": [
        352,
        560
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "options": {},
        "operation": "pdf",
        "binaryPropertyName": "={{ $input.item.binary.CV }}"
      },
      "typeVersion": 1.1
    },
    {
      "id": "1884fd50-23d9-4c7d-bcbf-1c9673ac9ad3",
      "name": "When CV Uploaded",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.formTrigger",
      "position": [
        128,
        560
      ],
      "webhookId": "bc7f9a94-dfef-4693-8f0b-2de37f168475",
      "parameters": {
        "path": "=blind-job-application",
        "options": {},
        "formTitle": "Blind Job Application Form",
        "formFields": {
          "values": [
            {
              "fieldType": "file",
              "fieldLabel": "CV",
              "multipleFiles": false,
              "requiredField": true,
              "acceptFileTypes": ".pdf"
            },
            {
              "fieldLabel": "Message to the recruiter",
              "placeholder": "Your message",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldType": "number",
              "fieldLabel": "What is 2+10+4?",
              "placeholder": "Captcha",
              "defaultValue": "3",
              "requiredField": true
            },
            {
              "fieldType": "dropdown",
              "fieldLabel": "I acknowledge and agree that my uploaded CV will be processed by automated systems and human reviewers for recruitment evaluation purposes. I understand this information may be stored in our hiring platform and accessed by relevant team members involved in candidate selection.",
              "fieldOptions": {
                "values": [
                  {
                    "option": "I agree"
                  }
                ]
              },
              "requiredField": true
            }
          ]
        },
        "formDescription": "Just send your CV and we will match the best role for you."
      },
      "typeVersion": 2
    },
    {
      "id": "b729cd71-5f19-459e-a3fb-7b0f685c2e97",
